From 395675b72a91a970e99c1096ddbde806b2d465b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:25:04 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: Add support for common optical frontend transmitter GPIO

Introduce a standardized `tx-disable-gpios` property to control optical
transmitter interlocks. The subsystem core manages the GPIO state
automatically, ensuring safe startup and shutdown sequences for
providers.

Additionally, remove the legacy SFF-8472 compatibility interface and
refactor the Airoha LDDLA driver to use the standard optical frontend
infrastructure.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
